WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.387
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.997 --> 00:00:06.634
- Today I'm cutting my best friend's hair.

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:08.874
- I'm outgoing in a more spiritual way,

00:00:08.874 --> 00:00:10.093
and she's really outgoing,

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:12.612
like I feel like she's
the next broadway star.

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:17.612
- She would look ravishing
in a long, longer bob,

00:00:17.813 --> 00:00:22.376
kind of similar to Kate
Bosworth, I'm thinking.

00:00:22.376 --> 00:00:24.291
- That's a lot of hair.

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:26.172
- So, I think the best haircut style

00:00:26.172 --> 00:00:29.537
would be like the long
layers, like Sofia Vergara.

00:00:29.537 --> 00:00:31.174
- It makes me really nervous that

00:00:31.174 --> 00:00:34.971
I can't see you cutting my hair.

00:00:34.971 --> 00:00:36.295
Like, there's no mirror.

00:00:36.295 --> 00:00:38.779
- I'm a little nervous,
but at the same time,

00:00:38.779 --> 00:00:41.797
I have a lot of trust in her,
so I think this will be good.

00:00:41.797 --> 00:00:44.316
(ominous music)

00:00:44.316 --> 00:00:45.742
- Sorry if I'm touching your boobie.

00:00:45.742 --> 00:00:47.404
(scissors cutting)

00:00:47.507 --> 00:00:49.385
(squealing)

00:00:49.385 --> 00:00:51.648
(nervous laughter)

00:00:51.648 --> 00:00:53.285
- No, it looks really good.

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:56.559
- Maybe 'cause I have thick, wavy hair,

00:00:56.559 --> 00:00:59.217
it won't show too much.

00:00:59.217 --> 00:00:59.925
- Yeah.

00:00:59.925 --> 00:01:01.237
- If it's bad.

00:01:01.237 --> 00:01:03.199
(laughing)

00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:04.778
- No, it's not bad.

00:01:04.778 --> 00:01:08.539
- It just sounds like a ton of hair

00:01:08.539 --> 00:01:10.780
coming off of my head right now.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:13.462
- You have particularly loud hair.

00:01:13.462 --> 00:01:15.099
- Are you cutting upwards?

00:01:15.099 --> 00:01:15.818
- No.

00:01:15.818 --> 00:01:16.956
(laughing)

00:01:16.956 --> 00:01:18.866
- I don't think that does anything.

00:01:18.866 --> 00:01:20.056
- Don't look at it.

00:01:20.056 --> 00:01:25.056
- It's not nearly as bad as
you think it is, I promise.

00:01:25.374 --> 00:01:26.567
- Well, I didn't think it was that bad.

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:29.768
(ticking music)

00:01:29.768 --> 00:01:32.136
- Well, if you ever doubt
that I trust you, Elizabeth,

00:01:32.136 --> 00:01:34.557
we have this video to look back on.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.548
- I'm just going to do like
a trim this right here,

00:01:36.548 --> 00:01:40.919
because, I'm just gonna
keep this nice and even.

00:01:41.087 --> 00:01:46.087
- You keep saying "even,"
like it's not currently.

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:51.810
- No, it is even for the most part.

00:01:53.532 --> 00:01:55.412
- Turn to me real quick.

00:01:55.412 --> 00:01:56.805
- I love how you're trying to even it out

00:01:56.805 --> 00:01:59.231
by bringing one hair over to the other.

00:01:59.231 --> 00:02:00.275
I know what you're doing!

00:02:00.275 --> 00:02:00.681
(laughing)

00:02:00.681 --> 00:02:01.779
- This looks not bad.

00:02:01.779 --> 00:02:02.661
- What are we thinking?

00:02:02.661 --> 00:02:03.984
- I don't think it looks bad at all,

00:02:03.984 --> 00:02:05.842
I think it's a good amount of hair.

00:02:05.842 --> 00:02:08.854
- It not looking bad does
not mean that it looks good.

00:02:08.918 --> 00:02:10.903
(increasingly intense music)

00:02:10.903 --> 00:02:12.644
- Go ahead.

00:02:12.644 --> 00:02:15.008
- Okay.

00:02:15.105 --> 00:02:17.021
- Right, I know what I'm doing.

00:02:17.021 --> 00:02:17.938
- Okay.

00:02:17.938 --> 00:02:18.541
- Kind of.

00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:21.843
- This is chopped, chopped, a lot off.

00:02:21.843 --> 00:02:22.815
- Chop, chop.

00:02:22.815 --> 00:02:23.614
(laughing)

00:02:23.614 --> 00:02:25.915
- Okay, okay.

00:02:25.915 --> 00:02:26.657
I love you.

00:02:26.657 --> 00:02:27.714
(yelling)

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:30.115
- She should not cut anybody else's hair.

00:02:30.115 --> 00:02:30.924
(laughing)

00:02:30.924 --> 00:02:31.594
Ever again.

00:02:31.594 --> 00:02:32.098
- That's probably true.

00:02:32.098 --> 00:02:35.384
- I am surprised, but I am happy with it,

00:02:35.384 --> 00:02:36.545
I'm really happy with it.

00:02:36.545 --> 00:02:40.384
She didn't cut it too short,
and there is some layering.

00:02:40.384 --> 00:02:42.872
Very minor, but there is
some layering going on here,

00:02:42.872 --> 00:02:44.311
I see it, it's good.

00:02:44.311 --> 00:02:45.217
(sighing)

00:02:45.217 --> 00:02:46.238
- I still love you.

00:02:46.238 --> 00:02:47.921
- Aww, she loves me.

00:02:47.921 --> 00:02:50.359
- But, I'm definitely going
to the salon tomorrow.

00:02:50.359 --> 00:02:51.102
(laughing)

00:02:51.102 --> 00:02:52.519
- I thought I was going to
be stressing out over there,

00:02:52.519 --> 00:02:53.888
but I had a good time.

00:02:53.888 --> 00:02:54.678
- Yeah.

00:02:54.678 --> 00:02:56.083
- And you look great, I love it.

00:02:56.083 --> 00:02:57.719
- I love it too, thank you.

00:02:57.719 --> 00:03:00.674
(upbeat music)

